{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确认大家的视线集中过来后，我继续说了下去。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然我是觉得这种事情没必要这样向大家报告」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「虽然我是觉得这种事情没必要这样向大家报告」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我和美羽学姐开始交往了」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新、新吾……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2047", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不喜欢偷偷摸摸的，所以想和大家把话说清楚……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「我不喜欢偷偷摸摸的，所以想和大家把话说清楚……」", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到学姐满脸通红的样子，我也开始觉得脸变得烫了起来。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "看到学姐满脸通红的样子，我也开始觉得脸变得烫了起来。", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然现在还是在大家面前，但我还是牵起了学姐的手。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2048", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐也回握住了我的手，但周围的大家一点反应都没有。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真难受啊，这种像是要杀了我一样的情况……", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就、就是这样，我说完了」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我低下头偷偷观察大家的表情。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后发现，纱凪正一个人忍笑忍得肩膀一直在颤抖。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "然后发现，纱凪正一个人忍笑忍得肩膀一直在颤抖。", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……纱凪，我可不是在说笑」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗，啊哈哈哈。没办法，你紧张成那个样子实在是太奇怪了」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「噗，啊哈哈哈。没办法，你紧张成那个样子实在是太奇怪了」", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……安洁我也差不多忍到极限了。真是的，明明我是非常想立刻祝福两位的」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「唉……安洁我也差不多忍到极限了。真是的，明明我是非常想立刻祝福两位的」", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3448", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我开始有点好奇你们两位是怎么相处的了……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": "「我开始有点好奇你们两位是怎么相处的了……」", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4462", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哈哈」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1328", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被樱乃这样指着，我突然感到非常羞耻。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的恭喜两位了，新吾同学、美羽学姐。两位一定会有一个非常有活力的孩子的」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「真的恭喜两位了，新吾同学、美羽学姐。两位一定会有一个非常有活力的孩子的」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3449", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，你说这个有点太早了吧……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在那之前，我是不会让美羽学姐的纯洁被你这家伙玷污的」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「在那之前，我是不会让美羽学姐的纯洁被你这家伙玷污的」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这……其实已经玷污了。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2049", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，我的也已经献给学姐了。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……昨天还第一次被用嘴做了。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，要加油生一个健康的孩子」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1329", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃，要生的不是你哥吧」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4463", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你明白的吧？\\n　可不要想什么和美羽学姐交尾的事」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「新吾，你明白的吧？　可不要想什么和美羽学姐交尾的事」", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交、交尾……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱，女孩子还是不要说交尾这种词汇了」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "「纱纱，女孩子还是不要说交尾这种词汇了」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3450", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交尾」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1330", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃你快停下好吗？交尾这种词也太下流了」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4464", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉大伙突然间就在一个劲地说下流的词汇。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2050", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……算了。只要能看到学姐的笑容，这都不是什么大事了。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这下子终于不用再在意周围大家的目光了。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论在哪都可以和美羽学姐亲热了……！", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，要乖乖的哦。现在就给你」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2051", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶呀……变得比之前大了？」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2052", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，真是有精神～」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2053", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，亲亲热热。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐现在正在给熊喵的尾巴做新的装饰。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "学姐现在正在给熊喵的尾巴做新的装饰。", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她们那么开心，我也不好说什么了。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "看到她们那么开心，我也不好说什么了。", "plain_idx": 376, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么样，小熊喵？会痛吗？」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2054", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜溜——」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0398", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太好了……一直没能见面，一定让你寂寞了吧」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「太好了……一直没能见面，一定让你寂寞了吧」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2055", "char_id": "みう"}]}
