{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦，稍微等等哦。现在就帮你准备……」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2059", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要我帮忙吗？」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，没事的。你就好好休息吧？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2060", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐从架子上取下罐头，熟练地把罐头里的东西装到容器里。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "美羽学姐从架子上取下罐头，熟练地把罐头里的东西装到容器里。", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始我只是在旁边看着而已，但后面我实在忍不住抱了上去。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "一开始我只是在旁边看着而已，但后面我实在忍不住抱了上去。", "plain_idx": 399, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也肚子饿了吗～？」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2061", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不好意思，打扰你了」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有那回事。我也是想着给小熊喵准备好饭后就和新吾抱抱」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「没有那回事。我也是想着给小熊喵准备好饭后就和新吾抱抱」", "plain_idx": 403, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2062", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就先抱抱学姐吧」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，等等。我先给小熊喵……啊」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2063", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把学姐抱得更紧，然后亲上了她的脖子。学姐的反应非常敏感。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "我把学姐抱得更紧，然后亲上了她的脖子。学姐的反应非常敏感。", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不好意思。发出了奇怪的声音」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2064", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_22.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到学姐害羞的反应，我越发想放纵起来。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": "看到学姐害羞的反应，我越发想放纵起来。", "plain_idx": 411, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
